%--------------------------------------------------------------------------
In this directory we plot figures for the Lorenz system;
%--------------------------------------------------------------------------
\Lorenz_graphs\Lorenz_Tvp_Tesc_Lc_graph_kes\ -> Here we plot the statistics 
for the NGRC DDE system learned by the Lorenz system; We compute 
Tvp and Tesc (see below);

Computing Tvp -> We scan the NGRC parameter Lc (Transversal LE), and for each
value of Lc perform 500 numerical experiments with random initial conditions of the
chaotic attractor; for each experiment, we compute the time at which the NGRC
solution escapes from the small window from the original system (at the start 
the original system and NGRC are set at the same initial conditions), i.e. we
compute 500 values of Tvp (time of valid prediction), and plot the quartiles for them;

Computing Tesc ->  We scan the NGRC parameter Lc (Transversal LE), and for each
value of Lc perform 500 numerical experiments with random initial conditions of the
chaotic attractor; for each experiment, we compute the time at which the NGRC 
solution escapes from the chaotic attractor, e.g. the time at which the magnitude
of NGRC solution exceeds some large  number (specifically 2); we thus compute 500
values of Tesc (escape times), and plot the quartiles for them;
%--------------------------------------------------------------------------
plot_Tvp_Tesc_Lc_v4_k.m -> this file plots the graph;
%--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Tesc_attr_Lc_tot_N500.mat -> this data contains the results of computations
of the NGRC DDE system learned by the HMR system; We here compute statistics of Tesc;
Here the following values of Lc are scanned: 
% Lc=[-1 -3 -5 -7 -8 -9 -10 -11 -12 -50]; 
